{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#517","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#517","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#517\",\"parent_revision\":\"be875592dff69f0e8452e34ba3830c6f4f137d66ab04f21aab3e9720ecfd7b28\",\"root_revision\":\"be875592dff69f0e8452e34ba3830c6f4f137d66ab04f21aab3e9720ecfd7b28\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nThe FM009 state machine in `plugins/plugin-creator/scripts/plugin_validator.py` sets `current_top_level_key = 'mcp'` for scalar forms (`mcp: null`, `mcp: false`) just as it does for block mappings. Scalar forms have no indented children, so any subsequent indented line belonging to a different block key is incorrectly treated as inside `mcp:` and skipped by the ecosystem guard. The fix must distinguish scalar vs. block top-level lines so that `current_top_level_key` is not carried forward after a scalar `mcp:` line. A new unit test exercising `mcp: null` followed by a Claude Code field with a colon must be added, and all 26 existing tests must continue to pass.\\n\\n## Fact-Check\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n**Claim 1**: FM009 state machine is in `plugins/plugin-creator/scripts/plugin_validator.py`.\\n**Status**: SUPPORTED \u2014 #559 fact-check (2026-04-15) confirmed `plugin_validator.py` is active with FrontmatterValidator at line ~1849.\\n\\n**Claim 2**: Scalar `mcp:` form sets `current_top_level_key = 'mcp'` incorrectly.\\n**Status**: UNVERIFIED \u2014 line numbers and exact code path not confirmed in this session. Requires reading the file at work time.\\n\\n**Claim 3**: Fix must target `plugin_validator.py`.\\n**Status**: CONDITIONAL \u2014 true only if item #1129 (skilllint migration) is not yet complete when work begins. If #1129 is complete, fix targets upstream `skilllint` package instead.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000